"# ◆ agento audit

> 30 days · 412 sessions · 12,408 requests  
> \`~/.claude2/projects\` · API prices as of 2026-10-05 · 2026-10-05 17:02
>
> ⎿ Amounts are API-equivalent: a subscription charges nothing, the real constraint is the weekly limit.

## Spend · **$317.20** *fact*

*What your tokens cost at API list prices.*

main thread: $272.80 · subagents: $44.40 (14%)

| Model | Requests | Cost | Share |  |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |
| \`opus-5.5\` | 7,940 | $255.40 | 81% | \`████████████████████\` |
| \`opus-5\` | 1,380 | $35.30 | 11% | \`██▊\` |
| \`sonnet-5.5\` | 1,610 | $17.05 | 5% | \`█▍\` |
| \`haiku-4.5\` | 1,478 | $9.45 | 3% | \`▊\` |

daily: \`▁▃▃▄▄▄▁▁▃▄▅▅▃▁▁▄▅▅▄▃▁▁▄▆█▆▄▂▃▄\` Sep 6 → Oct 5

**weekly** — on a subscription, watch your heaviest week

| Week of | Cost |  |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| Aug 31 | $2.27 | \`▌\` |
| Sep 7 | $60.26 | \`███████████▋\` |
| Sep 14 | $65.94 | \`████████████▊\` |
| Sep 21 | $71.62 | \`█████████████▉\` |
| Sep 28 | $103.47 | \`████████████████████\` peak |
| Oct 5 | $13.64 | \`██▋\` |

**Projects**

| Project | Sessions | Cost | Share |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| \`~/Projects/agento\` | 131 | $118.40 | 37% |
| \`~/Projects/billing-api\` | 88 | $74.20 | 23% |
| \`~/Projects/web-dashboard\` | 74 | $52.90 | 17% |
| \`~/Work/infra-terraform\` | 52 | $31.50 | 10% |
| \`~/Projects/dotfiles\` | 38 | $21.30 | 7% |

*2 more*

**Effort by spend:** \`max\` 38% · \`xhigh\` 30% · \`high\` 22% · \`medium\` 8% · \`low\` 2%

- fast mode: $12.80 (4%)
- cost-state check: 288 of 301 sessions within ±10%, median deviation 2%, worst 17%

## Buckets

*What the bill is made of. Cache writes cost several times a read.*

| Bucket | Cost | Share |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| cache write | $131.50 | 41% |
| cache read | $117.20 | 37% |
| output | $62.40 | 20% |
| input | $6.10 | 2% |

## Cache

*Share of context served from cache, and what misses cost.*

**hit ratio:** 91% (main)

**Losses from misses:** $27.10 *estimate*

| Cause | Events | Cost |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| TTL expired | 212 | $14.20 |
| model switch | 48 | $6.30 |
| compaction | 61 | $4.90 |
| effort change | 9 | $0.90 |
| unclear cause | 14 | $0.80 |

## Cache TTL

*How long the cache lives and how often your pauses outlast it.*

- ● now: **5 minutes**
- ○ suggested: **1 hour** — ≈ $11.40/mo *estimate*

**gaps between requests**

| Gap | Requests |  |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| <1m | 6,120 | \`████████████████████\` |
| 1–5m | 2,980 | \`█████████▊\` |
| 5–15m | 1,010 | \`███▎\` |
| 15–60m | 640 | \`██▏\` |
| >60m | 380 | \`█▎\` |

> The 2× write premium pays for itself: 1,020 pauses of 5 to 60 minutes cost more.

## Tasks

*Light tasks on expensive models, and effort you did not need.*

1,034 tasks, 540 of them light (52%)

- light tasks on Opus/Fable: **392** · $71.80
- on Sonnet this would be ≈ $33.60, difference **−$38.20** *estimate*
- effort max/xhigh on light tasks: **112**

**costliest light tasks**

| Task | Model | Cost |
| --- | --- | ---: |
| fix the typo in the README heading and update the build badge, the link broke a… | \`opus-5.5·max\` | $4.62 |
| rename the userId variable to accountId across the billing module | \`opus-5.5·xhigh\` | $3.87 |
| which node version does CI use and where is it set? | \`opus-5·max\` | $3.31 |

## Subagents

*Background agents: own cache, so any model is safe to pick.*

14% of spend · 2,204 calls · $44.40

\`opus-5.5\` $20.10 · \`sonnet-5.5\` $15.00 · \`haiku-4.5\` $9.30

**by type**

| Type | Requests | Cost |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| \`general-purpose\` | 1,210 | $27.80 |
| \`Explore\` | 640 | $9.40 |
| \`workflow-subagent\` | 310 | $5.90 |
| \`fork\` | 44 | $1.30 |

- 640 Explore (or read-only) subagents on pricey models cost $25.60, on haiku ≈ $5.60 — difference **−$20.00** *estimate*
- 95 general-purpose subagents on Opus/Fable cost $18.40, on Sonnet ≈ $9.10 — upper bound, difference **−$9.30** *estimate*

## Dead context

*Re-reading old context after the topic changed.*

37 times old context was re-read after a topic change: up to ≈ **$14.60** if you had started with /clear after each topic change *estimate*

- /clear or a new session before a new topic, once the prefix passes 60k

## Setup

*The fixed prefix you pay for at every session start.*

startup prefix ≈ 23.4k tokens · **$41.30** over the period *fact*

| File | Size | Tokens | Read per month |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| \`~/Projects/billing-api/CLAUDE.md\` | 60.4 KB | ≈ 17.2k | $29.40/mo |
| \`~/Projects/agento/CLAUDE.md\` | 9.2 KB | ≈ 2.6k | $6.10/mo |
| \`~/.claude2/CLAUDE.md\` | 1.1 KB | ≈ 306 | $0.70/mo |

*tokens ≈ bytes / 3.6; right: cache-read cost per 30 days*

## Model switch

*What switching the model mid-task would have cost.*

| switch | prefix | penalty | gain/step | break-even |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| \`opus-5.5\` → \`sonnet-5.5\` | 100k | $0.23 | +$0.022 | 11 steps |
| \`opus-5.5\` → \`haiku-4.5\` | 100k | $0.11 | +$0.031 | 4 steps |
| \`sonnet-5.5\` → \`opus-5.5\` | 60k | $0.15 | −$0.022 | never |
| \`opus-5.5\` → \`opus-5\` | 60k | $0.36 | −$0.010 | never |

> agento never switches the model mid-task: the cache does not carry over, so the penalty is a full prefix rewrite. The model is picked at task start, after /clear and in subagents.

## Top actions

1. **Light tasks on Sonnet·medium instead of Opus** — ≈ $38.20/mo *estimate*  
   392 tasks fit into 8 requests and 2 edited files. Upper bound: Sonnet will not handle every one.
2. **Explore subagents on haiku** — ≈ $20.00/mo *estimate*  
   640 code searches ran on Opus and Sonnet: reading files does not need a strong model.
3. **1-hour cache instead of 5 minutes** — ≈ $11.40/mo *estimate*  
   You had 380 pauses over an hour and 640 over 15 minutes: each one paid for a context rewrite.
4. **/clear before a new topic (prefix over 60k)** — ≈ $11.00/mo *estimate*  
   37 times a new topic started in a long context: up to ≈ $14.60/mo if you had started with /clear after each change.
5. **general-purpose subagents on Sonnet** — ≈ $9.30/mo *estimate*  
   95 general-purpose subagents ran on Opus/Fable; upper bound: Sonnet will not handle every such task.

*together up to ≈ $89.90/mo (28% of monthly spend); estimates overlap, so this is an upper bound.*

---

<sub>14,902 duplicate rows dropped · 3 malformed lines · 21 requests on unknown models not counted · Computed locally, nothing was sent anywhere.</sub>
"
`;

